                                                                <td>The ISA Deep Seabed and Ocean Database has been designed to serve as a spatial, internet-based data management system. Its main function is to host all deep seabed activities related data and in particular, data collected by the contractors on their exploration activities, as well as any other relevant environmental and resources related data for the Area.</td>
